Description: Keel overlay: Coraza, the WAF inside Nginx
 The Coraza overlay of Keel Linux (handbook decisions 0030 and 0036): the
 Coraza module for Nginx and the OWASP Core Rule Set, both built by Keel,
 and the overlay manifest keel reads, installed as
 /usr/share/keel/overlays/coraza.yaml (decision 0041).
 .
 The overlay is installed disabled, the state of a simple installation:
 the module is not loaded, since it costs memory in every worker even when
 unused. /usr/lib/keel/overlays/coraza/state turns it on and off; turning
 it on reloads Nginx and checks that the workers are alive and that a Core
 Rule Set probe gets 403, and rolls back otherwise.
